diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b5fe1b2a4feac926b16f4b55fd72f2bb6eb7b711..379952629a00992d429f4103aecb5cc8f88506cf 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,15 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` creates an isolated, in-memory service for boards and sails. Add equipment with
+an ID, its kind, and a non-negative integer daily price in euro cents. Use `quote()` to calculate a
+rental's price and `book()` to reserve it.
+
+Rental requests use UTC ISO-8601 timestamps at midnight and form half-open periods: the `end` is the
+midnight that begins the day after the final rented day. Overlapping reservations for one item are
+rejected, while adjacent reservations are allowed. Booking IDs are deterministic and sequential within
+one service instance. Cancellations are not exposed yet; the future cancellation operation will apply
+the school's stated 24-hour refund policy.
